// lexdb_exec: the functions and catalog values of design/lexdb-dialect-gaps.md package A,
// checked against PostgreSQL 18 (generated by tests/lexdb/gen_pg.py from
// dialect_queries.txt): SYSTEM_USER, quote_ident, pg_get_viewdef, pg_sequences.last_value,
// extract of the fields of an interval and of a timestamp difference, AT TIME ZONE 'UTC'
// and make_interval. Each expect line: a query's rows or tag, or ERROR and its SQLSTATE.
